{"title":"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a primitive cube root of one (this means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/e/d6e52bd429c72b3dfcd4920d9eb2a8e95d1f54e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 =1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad5bbe2f9b892002142e1c936565aee704d4f141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ne 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />) compute the value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/3/4d3fe43557d68d9c46f840e5241e58392fcc1dd9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{2006}+\\frac{1}{x^{2006}}+x^{2007}+\\frac{1}{x^{2007}}.\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/e/82ec23a41e8691c2067b66547872d26d04c68859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"33\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64e390522d6104c62f7dac4039bfc6f4dcec257f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc5611b36757944e8d5e153d4ad7afbfd0aa3f7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2006}=x^2$\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/c/6cc286299eafc016b031535a5e86e8fb443f67e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2007}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324cf9bcad0651289f1841b4afa88bb25fcb2983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\frac{1}{x}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II\">2007 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\